  m_text: "<u><b>Goz-AR v1.0</b></u>\n\nan Augmenter Reality game demo \ndeveloped
    in Unity 2020.3 \nwith AR-Foundation 4.1.7 \nand a bunch of free assets\n\n<i>it
    started as a completely different project, but the Lord works in mysterious ways
    ...</i>\n\nIt is my first game. \nPlease, be gentle with me :)\n\nIf you have
    any suggestions or if you wish to participate to my next project, email me.\n\nMy
    email:   pepposmart@gmail.com \nMy GitHub:   https://github.com/PeppoSub/\n\nSpecial
    thanks to Lele & Max.\nAnd look forward to my next game!\n"
